                <pb facs="1266" n="1116" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg1116"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Rockhill to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-03-29"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 29,
                    1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill says that the under secretary for foreign affairs informed him
                    yesterday that the Chinese Government assents and that telegraphic instructions
                    will be sent, as department suggests.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
